[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5701.75, "timestamp": "01:35:01", "text": "如果你喜欢《任天堂明星大乱斗》，那就算收支平衡了。不要砸碎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5704.07, "timestamp": "01:35:04", "text": "呃，即使你疯狂按键……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5706.47, "timestamp": "01:35:06", "text": "比如科技之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5709.99, "timestamp": "01:35:09", "text": "是的。感觉现在大部分时间都非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5712.55, "timestamp": "01:35:12", "text": "我们已经习惯了，我们一直在施加如此多的压力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5715.75, "timestamp": "01:35:15", "text": "同时按下按钮。 M：就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5719.51, "timestamp": "01:35:19", "text": "就是为此而生的。所以它好像有种习惯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5721.83, "timestamp": "01:35:21", "text": "把你的所有指纹都留在上面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5724.149, "timestamp": "01:35:24", "text": "这是最"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5728.47, "timestamp": "01:35:28", "text": "呃，那件事真糟糕。尤其是当我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5731.75, "timestamp": "01:35:31", "text": "兄弟用它，我就说，“别，兄弟。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5734.709, "timestamp": "01:35:34", "text": "不做。你吃着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5736.149, "timestamp": "01:35:36", "text": "一切以及玩弄同样的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5738.629, "timestamp": "01:35:38", "text": "东西。” E."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5741.189, "timestamp": "01:35:41", "text": "等等，你买的是黑色版，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5743.99, "timestamp": "01:35:43", "text": "我想我也有黑色的那款。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5746.47, "timestamp": "01:35:46", "text": "需要四个以上的控制器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5748.87, "timestamp": "01:35:48", "text": "啊，所以你可以和一群人一起玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5751.669, "timestamp": "01:35:51", "text": "人们。好的。是的，我身边有人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5754.55, "timestamp": "01:35:54", "text": "即将到来等等。我确实玩过那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5757.83, "timestamp": "01:35:57", "text": "很好。是的。和朋友们一起玩得很开心"}]